SUMMARY:Victor Jones
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Victor Jones is a dance rock singer/songwriter based in Brookly
 n\, NY. He plays music for mental breakdowns that can only be resolved wit
 h a raging party or a cathartic singalong. Victor gained success with his 
 concept album “Zookeeper” and singles like “Mother Teresa” and “
 I Get Hurt\,” the latter reaching millions of people on social media. He
  is 6’3” if that’s important to you.\nhttps://therockwell.org/calend
 ar/victor-jones/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/victor-jones/
